  "method_judgments": [
    {
      "topic": "Normalization and scale",
      "judgment": "Source header explicitly says ArrayStudio v9 RMA. Deposited probe range 2.3167 to 14.1736 is compatible with log2 RMA; source values were retained exactly without a second log transform or normalization."
    },
    {
      "topic": "GPL13158 annotation and probe collapse",
      "judgment": "Independent GPL parsing and base-R rowsum/count averaging exactly reproduce 43185 retained probes and 21117 genes. Ambiguous symbols and AFFX controls are excluded as declared; no placeholder symbol was retained. Mean log2 probe aggregation is an explicit frozen preprocessing choice and does not itself constitute a new biological measurement."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Unit and pairing",
      "judgment": "65 exact UC patients each contribute one post-minus-baseline delta. All baseline/post GSM, arm, response, age and Mayo values match the deposited source. There is no cell- or biopsy-level pseudoreplication in the delta models. Healthy and unpaired arrays are not model units in these contrasts."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Main and nuisance-factor branches",
