      "topic": "Clinical response comparisons",
      "judgment": "G_Yes minus G_No estimates a difference in paired transcript changes between eventual response groups. It is not a baseline predictive model, not a causal effect of response, and not endoscopic healing. The response-by-arm contrast is a post-treatment-stratified association contrast."
