      "topic": "Drug versus placebo inference",
      "judgment": "The fact that a within-golimumab contrast is significant and a placebo contrast is not does not establish a significant drug-placebo difference. The direct GLM_minus_Placebo contrast must support that statement. Complete-case biospecimen analysis is not the original trial intention-to-treat estimand."
